<title>POLAND: ComputerLand trades on kerb at PLN 54.5.</title>
<headline>ComputerLand trades on kerb at PLN 54.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 22,000 shares in ComputerLand at 54.5 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Monday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, ComputerLand was flat in 7,952 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
